</head>

<body>

  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="container nav-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="index.html">Nova vies.</a>

      <button class="menu-btn" type="button" aria-label="メニューを開く" aria-expanded="false">
        ☰
      </button>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="about.html">ABOUT</a>
        <a href="team.html">TEAM</a>
        <a href="coaching.html">COACHING</a>
        <a href="youth.html">YOUTH</a>
        <a href="event.html">EVENT</a>
        <a href="partner.html">PARTNER</a>
        <a href="contact.html" style="color:var(--gold-light)">CONTACT</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="page-hero">
    <div class="container page-hero-inner">
      <p class="section-label">CONTACT NOVA VIES.</p>

      <h1 class="gold-gradient">
        Start your<br>
        next challenge.
      </h1>

      <p class="page-hero-copy">
        チーム参加、個人レッスン、Youth、イベント、スポンサー・協業。<br>
        目的に合わせて、お気軽にご連絡ください。
      </p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>

    <section class="section fade">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="section-label">CONTACT CATEGORY</p>

        <h2 class="section-title gold-gradient">
          お問い合わせ内容を<br>
          お選びください。
        </h2>

        <div class="gold-line"></div>

        <div class="contact-grid">

          <div class="contact-card">
            <span class="tag">01 / TEAM</span>
